      "rationale": "ASV\/JPS: imezdag n Meɛun (Imeuniyen) — isem n leǧnas; KJV\/Geneva: 'timwalin\/imezdag' seg uẓar מעונה; neḥder talɣa n isem akken i d-yenna uḍris."
