      "rationale": "Taqbaylit tesra tamyurt 'yella', taɛbranit ur ɣiṭṭif ara tamyurt deg 'כי מרעה לצאנם שם'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "ḥermen-ten",
      "rationale": "ויחרימם d awal n lḥerm (ḥerem): ayen yettwawḥan\/iṛuh i Ṛebbi kan; 'kkes-ten meṛṛa' yugad ad yexḍeɛ talɣa-ns."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Widagi yettwarun s yismawen wwḍen deg wussan n Ḥizqiya, agellid n Yehuda, wwten ⟨את⟩ txamin-nsen d ⟨את⟩ Imeuniyen i d-yettwafen din, ḥermen-ten almi ass-agi, zedɣen deg umkan-nsen, acku din ⟨yella⟩ aṣaṭṭiḥ i yimisser-nsen.",
